  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and sauté until translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1-2 minutes.",
    "Add the mustard seeds and cook for 1-2 minutes.",
    "Add the tomato paste and cook for 1-2 minutes.",
    "Add the water and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer for 18-20 minutes.",
    "Add the cooked rice and stir to combine.",
    "Return the saucepan to the stovetop and cook over low heat for 5-7 minutes.",
    "Serve hot and garnish with lemon juice and fresh herbs."
